# No Hostinger deploy

Do not call Hostinger MCP tools (`user-hostinger`, `hosting_deploy-js-application`, TUS upload, `hosting_nodejs_start-build`, or any live deploy/upload).

After a build, run `npm run build` then `npm run pack:hostinger` so `dist/` and `hostinger-dist/` are ready. The user uploads that folder (or a zip of it) by hand.

Do not pack sqlite, credentials, or `.env` into the archive.
